  "Solution": {
    "S": "Increasing order of ligand field strength is:\n\n$$I^- < Br^- < Cl^- < S^{2-} < F^- < OH^- < C_2O_4^{2-}$$\n\n$$< H_2O < NCS^- < EDTA < NH_3 < en < CN^- < CO$$\n\nThus $CN^-$ is a strong field ligand. Hence the correct option is A."
